      "description": "Open Positions | VPAA | Rice University Skip to main content Body Rice University Vice Provost for Academic Affairs Menu Search Form Main Nav < back Home Meet our Team Faculty Open Positions New Faculty Activity Report Leave of Absence Career Resources Retirement Administrators Faculty Administration Faculty Salary All About TTT All About TP & RP All About NTT Interfolio FAR GA Edit Process Dual Career Department Review Forms VPAA Help Desk Close Faculty Open Positions / > Faculty > OPEN POSITIONS?V=2 Open Positions New Faculty Activity Report LOA Resources Retirement Faculty Open Positions Rice Benefits at a Glance Visit Houston For some openings in the Mathematics Department, please visit mathjobs.org . For questions, please contact the posting department or fill out our Help Desk form . Helpful Links Provost's Office University Policies Faculty Senate Faculty Handbook Fondren Library Research Repository Faculty Club Faculty Ombuds Office General Announcement Visit Houston VPAA Help Desk Interfolio 6100 Main St., Houston, TX 77005-1827 | Mailing Address: P.O. Box 1892, Houston, TX 77251-1892 | 713-348-0000 | Privacy Policy | Campus Carry Body Body Body"
